# Git & Contributing

## Branch Prefixes

- `feature/` — new capabilities (e.g. `feature/samsara-webhook-adapter`)
- `fix/` — bug fixes or precision adjustments (e.g. `fix/split-sleeper-clock-reset`)
- `adr/` — architectural decision records (e.g. `adr/006-event-store-indexing`)
- `refactor/` — internal improvements that do not alter deterministic outputs

## Commit Messages (Conventional Commits)

```
feat(engine): add split-sleeper berth 7/3 evaluation logic
fix(ingestion): correct timestamp truncation for geotab feeds
docs(adr): record ADR-005 timezone policy
test(engine): add 70h/8d rolling window edge cases
```

## PR Checklist

1. `make test` — all tests pass
2. `make lint` — Ruff, Mypy, Bandit clean
3. `make format` — code formatted
4. Engine changes include edge-case unit tests
5. Deterministic calculation outputs unchanged (or golden fixtures updated with justification)
